        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120240/extras/0c3ff2d21daaa7795a830e40fa469e5f.avif?t=1768515070\" width=742 height=437 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ClickCorp is a Roguelike RPG</strong>, where you take the very serious and required role of a HR manager - working at a failing startup, it is up to you! to keep the business from going bankrupt, choose who you will keep or fire, what sacrifices you'll be willing to make just to keep shareholders happy and <strong>generate as much shareholder value as possible!</strong> <br><br>Will the SEC investigate you?<br>Will investors find out your company doesn't do anything?<br>Will the staff leave in mass?<br><br>Its up to you to decide the fate of the company!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120240/extras/0c3ff2d21daaa7795a830e40fa469e5f.avif?t=1768515070\" width=742 height=437 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ClickCorp is a Roguelike RPG</strong>, where you take the very serious and required role of a HR manager - working at a failing startup, it is up to you! to keep the business from going bankrupt, choose who you will keep or fire, what sacrifices you'll be willing to make just to keep shareholders happy and <strong>generate as much shareholder value as possible!</strong> <br><br>Will the SEC investigate you?<br>Will investors find out your company doesn't do anything?<br>Will the staff leave in mass?<br><br>Its up to you to decide the fate of the company!</p>",
        "short_description": "Take on the position of a HR manager in this topical rogue like experience, generate shareholder value, liquidate people from their livelihoods in ClickCorp!",
